message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Axiomize Quantum Skills: a scientific modeling engine with quantum-inspired multi-branch reasoning"
abstract: >-
  Axiomize turns a plain-language idea into competing mathematical models. The modeling
  layer provides a versioned Model IR with explicit units, dimensional and numerical
  validation, calibration, uncertainty quantification and portable export, executed through
  a CLI, a REST API and an MCP server. A second, independent skill keeps several candidate
  hypotheses alive, scores them against evidence, prunes weak branches and collapses to a
  conclusion only when the evidence supports it.
